<title>FRANCE: French housing starts fall in 3-mos to end Feb 97.</title>
<headline>French housing starts fall in 3-mos to end Feb 97.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French housing ministry gave the following unadjusted figures on housing starts in</p>
<p>			     3-mos to end     12-mos to end</p>
<p>				 Feb  1997	 Feb 1997</p>
<p>HOUSING APPROVED</p>
<p> (total nos)		  74,500	  302,000</p>
<p> (y/y pct chg)		  -2.6	     -2.5</p>
<p> STARTED			66,300	  268,200</p>
<p> (percent)			-7.4	     -4.9</p>
<p>NON-HOUSE BUILDING</p>
<p>APPROVED</p>
<p> (sq metres)		 6.98 million	32.50 million</p>
<p> (y/y pct chg)		  -7.3	     -6.9</p>
<p> STARTED		     7.13 million	30.26 million</p>
<p> percent			  -7.6	     -3.7</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
